WEBVTT

00:08:26.627 --> 00:08:31.090
The industry that everyone loves to hate,

00:08:31.131 --> 00:08:34.760
who cares about the
environment and climate,

00:08:34.802 --> 00:08:36.804
is that industry.

00:08:37.346 --> 00:08:40.891
To scale geothermal,
what do we need to do?

00:08:41.559 --> 00:08:46.355
We need to efficiently, effectively
and safely drill below the surface

00:08:46.397 --> 00:08:49.608
over and over and over and over again.

00:08:49.650 --> 00:08:51.569
And who does that now?

00:08:51.610 --> 00:08:53.696
The oil and gas industry does that now.

00:08:54.446 --> 00:08:56.574
The oil and gas industry

00:08:56.574 --> 00:09:01.829
is a global specialized
workforce of millions,